WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:16.027
The next day Tom went to the picnic.

2
00:00:16.028 --> 00:01:05.917
He didn't bring Cat.

3
00:01:05.918 --> 00:01:09.259
Tom tried to play games.

4
00:01:09.260 --> 00:01:15.282
But he was still worried about Dirk.

5
00:01:15.283 --> 00:01:21.554
He got some food and sat down.

6
00:01:21.555 --> 00:01:24.448
Suddenly someone sat next to him.

7
00:01:24.449 --> 00:01:26.224
It was Ann!

8
00:01:26.225 --> 00:01:29.986
Tom dropped his plate in surprise.

9
00:01:29.987 --> 00:01:33.222
"I heard you were looking for me," Ann said.

10
00:01:33.223 --> 00:01:36.157
"I was at wizard school yesterday."

11
00:01:36.158 --> 00:01:39.610
Tom picked up his spilled food.

12
00:01:39.611 --> 00:01:43.412
"Why does Dirk hate me?" he asked.

13
00:01:43.413 --> 00:01:46.367
Ann looked sad.

14
00:01:46.368 --> 00:01:49.989
"My father is the head servant," she said.

15
00:01:49.990 --> 00:01:53.622
"But the royal wizard is much more powerful.

16
00:01:53.623 --> 00:01:56.428
This makes Father upset."

17
00:01:56.429 --> 00:02:00.141
"I've got a big problem," Tom said.

18
00:02:00.142 --> 00:02:04.381
He told Ann about Cat.

19
00:02:04.382 --> 00:02:08.317
"Dirk plans to tell everyone about Cat!"

20
00:02:08.318 --> 00:02:12.679
"Father did not like the last royal wizard either," Ann said.

21
00:02:12.680 --> 00:02:16.516
"That wizard put a bad spell on Father.

22
00:02:16.517 --> 00:02:19.789
He made him smell like a cat!

23
00:02:19.790 --> 00:02:23.119
So Father made the queen sneeze too!"

24
00:02:23.120 --> 00:02:25.351
Tom laughed.

25
00:02:25.352 --> 00:02:29.220
"Then the king learned of the spell," Ann said.

26
00:02:29.221 --> 00:02:34.096
"And he fired the royal wizard."

27
00:02:34.097 --> 00:02:38.062
"I'm going to get fired too," Tom said.

28
00:02:38.063 --> 00:02:40.595
"If Dirk tells the king and—"

29
00:02:40.596 --> 00:02:44.602
Ann suddenly jumped up and grabbed Tom's hand.

30
00:02:44.603 --> 00:02:47.631
"I just remembered something!" she said.

31
00:02:47.632 --> 00:02:53.227
"Come with me!"

